IELTS MASTER — COMPLETE WEBSITE DEVELOPMENT PROMPT

PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Build a complete, production-ready IELTS preparation platform called IELTS MASTER.

The platform must be a fully functional, publicly accessible web application, not a static website, visual mockup, prototype, or demonstration.

It is designed for students in Kazakhstan who want to prepare for the IELTS Academic and General Training examinations.

The website owner will share one public website link with students. Anyone who opens this link must be able to immediately access all available learning materials and begin preparing for IELTS.

There must be NO registration, NO sign-up, NO login, NO passwords, and NO personal account creation.

The website must be completely open and accessible to everyone without authentication.

Main requirements
	1.	The entire website must be in English only.
	2.	Anyone with the website link must have immediate access to the platform.
	3.	No registration, sign-up, login, passwords, or personal accounts.
	4.	No authentication or account approval system.
	5.	No subscriptions, payment methods, billing, or payment gateways.
	6.	At least 36 complete Reading tasks.
	7.	At least 36 complete Listening tasks.
	8.	At least 36 complete Writing tasks.
	9.	At least 36 complete Speaking tasks.
	10.	At least 36 complete Grammar exercises.
	11.	At least 500 unique English vocabulary entries.
	12.	Multiple complete IELTS mock examinations.
	13.	A professional, modern, responsive design.
	14.	All educational features must actually work.

Do not simplify or omit the required educational content.

